      "statement": "has_temporal_polarity_mismatch uses _paired_marker_mismatch() with temporal pairs (BC/ago, CE/BC, AD/BC, BCE/CE) and polarity pairs (oppose/support, reject/accept, denied/confirmed, failed/succeeded), returning True when exactly one side of a pair matches.",
